      {
        "author_name": "Claudia",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100144974139188836438/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXK8bLqcjZHTsAPJdYm4TTIsozg9T8wiid22R0JtOjNrAs4aITD=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "First time at their 'Christmas' market.  Very good variety of vendors and  pleasant surroundings.  Although lacking that Christmas ambiance, the effort was still appreciated.  My other suggestion would be for the organisers to re-think the layout.  The food vendors should have more alley space to avoid a crowded feeling.  Also would have preferred that the sani-vac toilets were not so in our face while disturbing the beautiful heritage facade.  Bonus was the charming Alpacas to entertain us.",
        "time": 1667691596,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jason S",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104239045363581492584/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVN3PjOLaJ1AD3zxsZUt8nmsHJKExGkmlyh7ZxvTFpTdtgP-Fg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "All you need is good company , this place delivers state of the art service and food is out of this world. The staff are super super courteous. The ambiance was great. If you want to host a small party this place has got what you need",
        "time": 1667608209,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Sue",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111588182390982547356/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJkEazTLUVAwwRcD_QUJaH1jSI_IYfNW5iWTKM2kN2-3QTVaQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Went there for their Christmas Fair.\nLots of vendors offering lots of different items including a few alpacas that could be petted.\nIt's on a beautiful site right on the river.\n\nIt was cold and windy and little did I know it was mostly outside. I felt sorry for the vendors.\n\nIf I go next year I will dress a lot warmer",
        "time": 1730910035,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
